{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:29:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_d2632a4fd34648909716145915d73107","id":"pg_407295674b4157aeac8058bc3d2c5945","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/urbint-cortex-license-md-b2897306c6cd-58bc3d2c5945.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_b8aeaf97976e5b9c9c973a846f812f1a"],"title":"urbint/cortex/LICENSE.md @ b2897306c6cd","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:29:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d2632a4fd34648909716145915d73107"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_145cdd6bdd81babc49572d1697fada88d86ac499e4a5f6c1e4dce78cb79e0ff4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Running is controlled via application config: an 'enabled' option that defaults to on, support for {:system, ENV_VAR, default} tuples such as CORTEX_ENABLED, and an inverted 'disabled' option for contexts like build or CI environments."},{"claim_ids":["clm_28e5831c26a3faad4404ca685e307a498a611e4dc7d81f36f812f54aebc7998a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product compiles and reloads modified files, automatically runs the appropriate tests at the appropriate time, and accepts pluggable adapters for custom builds."},{"claim_ids":["clm_51ec24c5ef775928953e202fc8f5888eb7330505f4c178bed895397ed55663ca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Cortex is described as an intelligent coding assistant for Elixir, installed by adding it as a Mix dependency (e.g. {:cortex, \"~> 0.1\", only: [:dev, :test]})."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5df61da6779547f1d88a68b57395b32ef6b71134b456367bd929281c952bbf06"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"For umbrella applications, users are instructed to add Cortex to each monitored sub-app's dependencies rather than the root mix.exs, because root umbrella dependencies are not automatically started, a process Cortex depends on."},{"claim_ids":["clm_830b26a1d96350b70ab92900339657b5813048fa85078cb237ecb28eaeee3ca6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Cortex runs automatically alongside the mix app (e.g. via iex -S mix); under MIX_ENV=test it automatically runs tests for saved test files and for tests paired with saved lib files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_85b90e6cdf183311f5fda813b65cebb76771208b11a6b87e743591a3adfe95e8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The software is licensed under the MIT license, and Phoenix users are instructed to run the app in interactive mode (iex -S mix phoenix.server)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8cc2b0cdad820a33aabc669f4f4e7f240ecb370056eb6a0e54abdfb4e96fd8f6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Cortex.focus filters test runs by a regular expression, a string compiled as a regex, an integer line number, or a keyword passed through unchanged to the include option of ExUnit.configure/1."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9493cec6a2530b4f140d50d9a2a50d2e9a640a157d0874cd1a90b3f86ebc419a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The roadmap lists unfinished items including Credo, Dialyzer, ExDash and custom mix task runners, per-module reload/test from IEx, broader OTP reload support, and auto-fetching dependencies when mix.exs changes deps."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bc8f161de8869e59aa59a9a9e9c063a023eb381bac3b49911bd73a8e4727a671"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Shell-facing commands are provided in the Cortex module: Cortex.all runs all stages (currently reload and test runner) on all project files, and Cortex.unfocus clears the currently configured focus."},{"claim_ids":["clm_de140b026f067271a1bd6f289483b8df06eeb143283bd457a434d70ef9d8cd3f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the project uses CircleCI for CI (badge plus changelog entries about adding CircleCI config and installing inotify-tools in CI), and changelog entries mention Credo and Dialyzer checks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_de609f1a30e7f2593f7da3fb89e3f7f785f820c819d7017c83843bc35dbe5d60"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A clear_before_running_tests config option clears the screen immediately before running tests and defaults to true."}],"claim_ids":["clm_145cdd6bdd81babc49572d1697fada88d86ac499e4a5f6c1e4dce78cb79e0ff4","clm_28e5831c26a3faad4404ca685e307a498a611e4dc7d81f36f812f54aebc7998a","clm_51ec24c5ef775928953e202fc8f5888eb7330505f4c178bed895397ed55663ca","clm_5df61da6779547f1d88a68b57395b32ef6b71134b456367bd929281c952bbf06","clm_830b26a1d96350b70ab92900339657b5813048fa85078cb237ecb28eaeee3ca6","clm_85b90e6cdf183311f5fda813b65cebb76771208b11a6b87e743591a3adfe95e8","clm_8cc2b0cdad820a33aabc669f4f4e7f240ecb370056eb6a0e54abdfb4e96fd8f6","clm_9493cec6a2530b4f140d50d9a2a50d2e9a640a157d0874cd1a90b3f86